Specific quantities include: 240 LF of bridge deck expansion joint rehabilitation with backer rod; 30 CF of polymer nosing for bridge deck expansion joint; 1 LS each for mobilization and maintenance of traffic for two projects; 128 HR for traffic control officers; 21,654 ED for work zone signs; 125,736 ED for channelizing devices; 6,006 ED for arrow boards; 1,356 ED for temporary changeable message signs.
