Place of Performance: The work will be performed at the Solid Waste Transfer Station located within the jurisdiction of the Central Florida Tourism Oversight District.
Bidder Requirements: Bidders must register on the PlanetBids™ platform to participate in the bidding process. There are preferences for local vendors, veteran small businesses, and opportunity zone businesses on most solicitations.

Background: The City of Delray Beach, Florida, is seeking quotes from qualified bidders for a Housing Rehabilitation Program under the NCS Division. The goal of this solicitation is to rehabilitate residential properties to improve living conditions and ensure compliance with safety standards. This initiative is part of the city's efforts to enhance community welfare and housing quality.
Work Details: The contractor will be responsible for a comprehensive list of services at the property located at 908 SW 3rd St, Delray Beach, FL 33444-0876. The specific tasks include:

