3) Install Mulch;
4) Remove and Replace Entry Door Unit;
5) Global Encasement;
6) HEPA/WET CLEAN/HEPA Interior Cleaning;
7) Tear Off Existing Roof and Install New Roof;
8) Flat Deck Cap Sheet Roof with Slope Roof Transition;
9) Provide Certified Plans;
10) Replace Porch Structure;
11) Replace Garage to Carport – Original Use;
12) Install Impact Windows;
13) Install Prehung Exterior Impact Door;
14) Paint House Complete;
15) Install Bi-fold Doors;
16) Repair Drywall;
